#!/usr/bin/env ssc
---
name: no-paren-list-method
version: 0.1.0
description: headOption on a list is emitted as a Rust field access; length beside it lowers.
---
```scalascript
def main(): Unit =
  val kept = ["a", "bb", "ccc"].drop(1).filter(r => r.length > 1)
  println("control = " + kept.length)
  println("defect  = " + kept.headOption.getOrElse("-"))
main()
```
